    "2 drawn capacitors ('sky130_fd_pr__model__cap_mim') written as a fixed-value 'C' card (the deck's nominal area+perimeter value) -- PDK process corners (e.g. mimcap_ff/mimcap_ss) do not apply to it, so schematic-vs-extracted deltas at non-typical corners include a capacitor-corner term; pass --pdk to bind the PDK capacitor subcircuit instead. See docs/cli/extract.md's 'SPICE model binding' section.",
